OL,3,GNEWSACrane causes 'severe delays' at
OL,4,ADartford Crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are severe delays at the Dartford
OL,7,FCrossing between Kent and Essex due to
OL,8,Fa broken-down crane which is leaking
OL,9,Foil, according to National Highways.
OL,11,FThe government agency said the west
OL,12,F(left) bore of the tunnel was closed as
OL,13,Fteams work to remove the stranded
OL,14,F50-tonne vehicle.
OL,16,FOnce the crane has been cleared the oil
OL,17,Fspill will need to be treated before
OL,18,Fthe A282 which links the southern and
OL,19,Fnorthern sections of the M25 can
OL,20,Freopen.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
