OL,3,GNEWSACrane causes 'severe delays' at
OL,4,ADartford Crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said shortly before
OL,7,F19:30 BST there were delays of two
OL,8,Fhours with congestion backing up to
OL,9,Fjunction three for the M20.
